import examples/sections/project_description.dl

set firstState to a new project state
set secondState to a new project state
set first to an instance of project window with state (the address of firstState)
set second to an instance of project window with state (the address of secondState)
print line the width of (the "blue" row of (project window's table))
click the "New Project" button in the address of first
click the "New Project" button in the address of first
click the "New Project" button in the address of second
print line firstState's count
print line secondState's count
print line first's status
print line second's status
click the "Draw" button in the address of first
print line first's status
close the address of first
close the address of second

section panel:
    result: UI reference
    body:
        children: many UI reference
    value:
        a UI container of kind 12 containing (the body's children)

window extended window:
    panel:
        button "Extra"
        toolbar:
            button "Nested"

set group to the UI child at 0 in extended window
print line group's kind
print line group's count
set bar to the UI child at 1 in group
print line (the UI child at 0 in bar)'s text

window unstyled window:
    2 x 1 table:
        "blue" row:
            "name"
            "amount"

print line the width of (the "blue" row of (unstyled window's table))
